"etf_text_networthPrompt" = "Net Value For Long = Net value at the last adjustment point * [1+ 3 * (Latest spot transaction price-spot last adjustment point price) / spot last adjustment point price * 100%]；\n\nNet Value For Short = Net value at the last adjustment point * [1- 3 * (Latest spot transaction price-spot last adjustment point price) / spot last adjustment point price * 100%]；\n\nPlease be cautious when trading at a price that deviates significantly from the net value";
"etf_text_etfPrompt" = "1. ‘3L’ implies the increase in price of the underlying pair by 1% and the net value of the product has increased by 3%.\n\n2.‘3S’ implies the decrease in price of the underlying pair by 1% and the net value of the product fell by 3%\n\n3. Typically, the net value is adjusted at 0’oclock every day. The extreme market will be adjusted in the intraday.\n\n4. Every leverage will charge the corresponding management fee on a daily basis.\n\n5. Please pay attention to the net value of the asset before trading. There is a risk of the price approaching zero in extreme conditions. Therefore, make sure to understand the risks involved.";
"etf_text_disclaimerDetail1" = "Dear clients：\n\nThanks for using the %@’s Leveraged Tokens products and relevant services. Please read the instructions carefully related to this and make sure to follow the below mentioned ‘Risk Tips’ carefully. By clicking on ‘I Agree’ you are deemed to agree with all the contents in the disclaimer, and are completely aware of the risks involved in Leveraged Tokens. \n\n";
