"etf_question_a"="What does the BTC3L Leveraged Token mean?";
"etf_question_b"="Leveraged Tokens are tokens that track spot gains and falls using a certain multiple, compared to ordinary leverage products, what are the main features of Leveraged Tokens?";
"etf_question_c"="Which of the following descriptions is inaccurate about Leveraged Tokens?";
