"etf_question_anwsersa"="If the price of BTC increases by 1%, the net value of the Leveraged Token will rise by about 3% & If the price of BTC decreases by 1%, the net value of the Leveraged Token will fall by about 3%";
"etf_question_anwsersb"="A pledge deposit is required, the product has an expiration date, there is a risk of position liquidation & No pledge deposit is required, no product expiration date, and no risk of position liquidation";
