"etf_question_anwserse"="Timed position adjustment: Daily fixed time point to adjust the leverage multiple to the target multiple, to ensure that the net value of daily tracking spot of a certain multiple & Adjust positions from time to time: When the tracked spot rises and falls reach the threshold, adjust positions from time to time to ensure that the net value of the Leveraged Token does not return to zero & Floating leverage adjustment position: when Leveraged Token's actual leverage multiple exceeds the set floating leverage range to adjust the position";
