"privacy_tips_title"="Privacy Protection Tips";
"privacy_tips_content1"="Welcome to %@! In order to better protect your personal rights and interests, we would like to introduce how we will standardize the secure collection, storage, protection, use, and provision of your information during the service process. Please fully understand:";
"privacy_tips_content2"="1. To ensure the stable operation of the APP or provide services, this product needs to request necessary phone permissions from you, including:\n· Read phone status and device information permissions (used to identify the device for security risk control)\n· Access to network status information permissions (used for network data requests)\n· Access to file read and write permissions (used for avatar settings and other file upload operations)\n· Access to camera, photo album, and biometric permissions (used for operations such as scanning QR codes and fingerprint quick login)\n· Other permissions required when using specific functions as listed in the privacy terms\nWhen you enable permissions, the APP will collect the necessary information.\n2. In order to take risk prevention measures to ensure the security of your account and funds, and to fulfill legal obligations such as KYC and AML, we need to collect your basic identity information, account information, transaction information, and device information within the necessary scope.";
